                    <span class="" style="font-size:4em;font-weight:bold">&lsquo;&lsquo;</span>
                    <p class="quote">
                        He is not a believer who fills his stomach while his neighbour goes hungry.
                    </p>
                    <p class="">Hadith | Sahih al-Bukhari</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            @* End Qoute Section*@
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/food-security/food package 6.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
            </p>
            <p>
                Amidst the dire circumstances around the world, the plight of children takes centre stage.
            </p>
            <p>
                More young lives succumb to the silent agony of undernutrition each year with a staggering 45% of all deaths among children under 5 are attributed to the insidious grip of malnutrition. <b>Donate now.</b>
            </p>
