    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
        <div class="col-md-6 " style="text-align:justify;font-size:18px;">
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em">
                Our Food Security Programs
            </h1>
            <p>At Human Relief Mission, our commitment spans over 15 years of collaborative efforts with communities worldwide. Recognising the vital significance of a nourishing diet, we are dedicated to the cause of ensuring that no child or adult experiences hunger. The act of providing sustenance to a family in need holds the power to be truly transformative.</p>
            <p>
                Our mission revolves around delivering sustainable, long-term food solutions to communities facing hardship. Additionally, we extend our support through short-term, lifesaving interventions in response to global emergencies, aiming to alleviate immediate food crises. Join us in this journey to make a lasting impact on the lives of those in need, as we strive to create a world where families are empowered through the gift of sustenance.
            </p>
            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12" style="text-align:center;">
                <div class="vertical-align-center" style="height: 150px; background-color: #eff3f6; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <img src="~/assets/custom-image/careshippingservicehandlingpackage_109799 (1).png" style="width: 100px; vertical-align: central;" />
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:30px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#660199;">
                    <span>Food Package</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12" style="text-align:center;">
                <div class="vertical-align-center" style="height: 150px; background-color: #eff3f6; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <img src="~/assets/custom-image/iconfinder-no-plastic-food-package-4454721_119738 (1).png" style="width:100px;padding:10px;" />
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:30px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#660199;">
                    <span>Hot Meals</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12" style="text-align:center;">
                <div class="vertical-align-center" style="height: 150px; background-color: #eff3f6; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <img src="~/assets/custom-image/bread_food_4690 (1).png" style="width:100px;padding:10px;" />
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:30px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#660199;">
                    <span>Bread Distribution</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>When you donate food packages, hot meals or naan breads to families in need you are helping save lives. Our teams on the ground perform necessary checks to scout for eligible beneficiaries to whom aid can be given. If an individual is eligible for zakat, they automatically become eligible for our food security programs. Once a list of beneficiaries has been selected, they are added to our beneficiaries’ records so they can be listed for our many other food security programs. </p>
            <p>
                Join hands with us by contributing to our food security projects, so Human Relief Mission can extend a lifeline to those facing malnutrition and hunger. Your donation will empower us to provide nourishment, a source of hope, whenever and wherever it is needed most. Together, let us forge a path towards a world where no one goes to bed hungry, and the echoes of compassion resonate louder than the cries of an empty stomach.
            </p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/assets/custom-image/4.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
            </p>
            <p style="font-size:14px;">Image: hot meals being cooked for displaced people in Afghanistan.</p>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    </div>


    @* BEGIN QURAN SAYS ABOUT HELPING ORPHAN*@
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
        <div class="col-md-6 " style="text-align:justify;font-size:18px;padding-left:0;padding-right:0;">
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em;">
                What does Islam teach about hunger?
            </h1>
            <p>In Islam, feeding the hungry is a highly-rewarded act of worship. The significance of feeding the hungry is emphasised in the following Hadith: </p>


            @* BEGIN Qoute Section 2 *@
            <div class="" style="padding-bottom:50px;margin-top:30px;">

                <div class="quote-container col-md-12">
                    <span class="" style="font-size:4em;font-weight:bold;color:#fff;">&lsquo;&lsquo;</span>
                    <p class="quote">Free the captives, feed the hungry and pay a visit to the sick.</p>
                    <p class="">Hadith | Sahih al-Bukhari</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
            @* End Qoute Section 2 *@

            <p>The Hadith above signify the importance of never thinking about oneself, but always those that are in need and how Allah will question us about our actions and wealth.</p>
            <p>During Ramadan, as well as other significant days in the Islamic calendar, Muslims fast from dawn to dusk. This means abstaining from food, water and intimacy. By going hungry for up to 20 hours a day in some parts of the world, we are taught to have greater empathy for those in need, for whom going hungry is not a choice. Fasting also helps to teach patience, and self-restraint, and helps us to draw closer to Allah. </p>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    </div>
    @* END QURAN SAYS ABOUT HELPING ORPHAN*@

