            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em;">
                Can you give food as Sadaqah?
            </h1>
            <p>Yes, you can give food as Sadaqah in Islam, if you do so for the sake of Allah. </p>

            <p>The above Hadith illustrates the importance in purifying your intention when giving food. If done for the right reasons, you can earn great rewards for feeding yourself and others. </p>
            <p>As well as giving food parcels to others, you can also help to gain the rewards of Sadaqah Jariyah by contributing to sustainable food sources which can benefit families for generations. </p>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    </div>
    @* END QURAN SAYS ABOUT HELPING ORPHAN*@

